at:df750ce7-fda1-5e9b-ba32-db96ec170577 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "WaveFunction"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A mathematical description of the quantum state of an isolated
quantum system. A wave function is a function of the degrees
of freedom corresponding to some maximal set of commuting
observables. Once such a representation is chosen, the wave
function can be derived from the quantum state."""@en ;
    rdfs:comment """A mathematical description of the quantum state of an isolated
quantum system. A wave function is a function of the degrees
of freedom corresponding to some maximal set of commuting
observables. Once such a representation is chosen, the wave
